## 7. Read-only mode

The operator declares read-only mode; never detect it yourself.

- **Why it happens here:** an arc-runner may run in this tree, and a second
  writer in the same working copy corrupts its ledger. When the operator says
  read-only, that is why.
- **Mirror root:** the operator nominates one per round.
